{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粵港澳大灣區首個知識型綜合保稅區，廣州知識城綜合保稅區正式封關運作。</p><p></p><p>保稅區位於廣州黃埔區，面積0.82平方公里，重點布局智能算力、精密設備保稅維修等，知識密集型產業將助力大灣區內經濟融合發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:47.561508+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:56.930711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:41.217949+00:00","content_hash":"209a27b751818b559451d37194b20a5636f472d9bba9bac8192425e27a07a0f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}